<p><a href="http://andbrowser.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Screenshot_2013-01-18-19-12-40.png"><img src="http://andbrowser.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Screenshot_2013-01-18-19-12-40-300x187.png" alt="" title="Xperia Tablet Z Home 1" width="300" height="187" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1317" /></a><br />
<a href="http://andbrowser.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Screenshot_2013-01-18-19-13-47.png"><img src="http://andbrowser.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Screenshot_2013-01-18-19-13-47-300x187.png" alt="" title="Xperia Tablet Z Home 2" width="300" height="187" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1318" /></a><br />
<a href="http://andbrowser.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Screenshot_2013-01-18-19-14-02.png"><img src="http://andbrowser.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/Screenshot_2013-01-18-19-14-02-300x187.png" alt="" title="Xperia Tablet Z Home 3" width="300" height="187" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1319" /></a><br />
